{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35169","headline":"句 · 司空图","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忍事敌灾星，物望倾心久。\n凶渠破胆频。\n鼎饫和方济，台阶润欲平。\n夜短猨悲减，风和鹊喜虚。\n骅骝思故第，鹦鹉失佳人。\n鲸鲵人海涸，魑魅棘林幽。\n棋声花院闭，幡影石坛高。\n地凉清鹤梦，林静肃僧仪。\n晚妆留拜月，春睡更生香。\n隔谷见鸡犬，山苗接楚田。\n人家寒食月，花影午时天。\n官路好禽声，轩车驻晚程。\n南楼山最秀，北路邑偏清。\n多病形容五十三，谁邻借笏趂朝参。\n十年太华无知己，只得虚中两首诗。\n看师逸蹟两师宜，高适歌行李白诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35169.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35169","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}